fix(config): match Sisyphus pattern - register conductor/planner as new agents + set default_agent

Previous approach overwrote agent.build / agent.plan with conductor/planner
prompts, but opencode strips/ignores unknown fields when those slots are the
built-ins. Switch to the proven Sisyphus pattern from oh-my-openagent:

- Register conductor and planner as NEW primary agents under their own keys
- Demote agent.build and agent.plan to { mode: 'subagent', hidden: true }
- Set config.default_agent = 'conductor' (only if user has not set one)
- SMOL_TO_OC removed; smol agent names now map 1:1 to opencode keys
- smol.json overrides keyed by smol name (conductor, planner, ...)
- smol-auto command targets agent: conductor; smol-plan targets planner
- Tests updated; 38/38 passing

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
